{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790402220, "covers_from": "2026-09-26T05:57:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-26T05:58:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790402280, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-26T05:57:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8884, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "路上的地到處都凹凹凸凸極度不平很危險，不管是行人還是車道，也缺乏無障礙空間，到處都是電箱或沒有人行道", "display_name": "信義代表 No.8,884", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-26T05:57:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 1966, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "房價太高，台北市長大卻住不起，只好搬到新北。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.1,966", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-26T05:57:23+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20363, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "希望台北能被綠化成綠色城市 可能是全球的模仿對象", "display_name": "大安代表 No.20,363", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-26T05:57:31+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36420, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "其他", "content": "居住 房租太貴 租了又難以入戶籍 台北居住大不便", "display_name": "中正代表 路西法Lucifer", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-26T05:57:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 11026, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "遮陽的樹木都修的很醜", "display_name": "文山代表 Ginger", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-26T05:57:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 12566, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "育兒", "content": "台北真的很多沒有後援的家長，彈性工時對很多雙薪家長來說真的很迫切需要", "display_name": "文山代表 No.12,566", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 1966, "sprite